  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capactity Building Poultry Feed Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve the local poultry and feed sector in Niamey, Niger.In addition to improving knowledge and the economic position of local feed producers, farmers themselves are also made aware of the importance of using good feed. In addition, attention is paid to alternative raw materials, such as local waste and plants that are not suitable for human consumption, by-products from the agri-food industry and insect meal or larvae, which can be produced locally.But unemployed young people and women can also use the gaps in the market to produce and trade chicken feed. This project will reduce Niger&apos;s dependence on imported raw materials in the longer term.</narrative>
  </description>
